[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/ring_buffer/tests/ring_buffer_impl_test.py: Implemented comprehensive unit tests for RingBuffer singleton covering: lifecycle initialization/registration, property checks (capacity, size, is_empty, is_full), push operations (available capacity, multiple items, overwrite eviction with FIFO order preservation), pop operations (FIFO order, BufferEmptyError on empty), clear (size reset, state restoration), snapshot (FIFO order, non-mutating, empty buffer), and integrated push/pop cycles with eviction.
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/ring_buffer/lib/ring_buffer.py: Implemented interface module: added @data_type decorators for BufferError/BufferEmptyError, @poly_type for RingBuffer Protocol, @operation/@test_only decorators on methods, all stub bodies with '...'. Fixed pretense import to use full package path.
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/ring_buffer/lib/ring_buffer_impl.py: Implemented concrete RingBuffer singleton using collections.deque(maxlen=capacity) with default capacity 10. Realized push with overwrite eviction (returns evicted item when full), pop with BufferEmptyError on empty, clear, and snapshot_items. Added @singleton_type/@override/@operation/@test_only decorators, fixed pretense import, removed contract slug references from comments.
